**Definition 7.4 (whole execution, without a price claim).** On one
actual evolving run of a system satisfying the stated local premises,
let $g_i^*$ be (OR.4) evaluated at each actual row fragment, and use
the actual prefix counts for an unfinished fragment $\eta$. In
particular define

$$
g^*(\eta)=4N_\eta+P_\eta+3B_\eta+9V_\eta
             +3R_\eta+2A_\eta+E_\eta;
